{"title":"Smokeslate","slug":"Smokeslate","hero":{"file":"Smokeslate.webp","width":400,"height":465},"pageid":743,"revid":14316,"timestamp":"2024-08-12T21:28:15Z","lastEditor":"Z3SC","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$10/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$16/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.4.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/03/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Smokeslate</b> is one of the various ore-holding stone nodes that spawn throughout Oaklands. They come in a medium range of sizes and can be found near <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan's_AutoLogistics/\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>.  \n</p><p>The smokeslate stone is colored a smoke-ish grey, being darker than <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lightslate/\">lightslate</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blueslate/\">blueslate</a> but significantly brighter than <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Darkslate/\">darkslate</a>. \n</p>\n<h4 id=\"the-chart-below-displays-all-possible-ores-that-spawn-within-this-node\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</h4>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Copper1\">Copper1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Copper/\">Copper</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Iron1\">Iron1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Iron/\">Iron</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lithium Oaklands\">Lithium Oaklands</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lithium/\">Lithium</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
